#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:248 crates/monet/src/main.rs:339
msgid ""
"Windows isn't installed yet. Choose Windows in the app menu to finish setting it up."
msgstr ""
"Windows ist noch nicht installiert. Wähle Windows im App-Menü, um es fertig einzurichten."

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:250
msgid ""
"Windows is encrypted with BitLocker. Type its recovery key in Settings › Games & Controllers, and Monet opens it and sets it up."
msgstr ""
"Windows ist mit BitLocker verschlüsselt. Gib seinen Wiederherstellungsschlüssel unter Einstellungen › Spiele & Controller ein, und Monet öffnet es und richtet es ein."

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:255
msgid ""
"Windows is asleep, so Monet can't set it up yet. Open Windows, choose Restart, and Monet finishes the rest."
msgstr ""
"Windows schläft gerade, daher kann Monet es noch nicht einrichten. Öffne Windows, wähle „Neu starten“, und Monet erledigt den Rest."

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:263
msgid "This PC didn't start in UEFI mode, so Monet can't switch to Windows."
msgstr ""
"Dieser PC wurde nicht im UEFI-Modus gestartet, daher kann Monet nicht zu Windows wechseln."

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:270 crates/monet/src/main.rs:593
msgid ""
"Windows wasn't found on this PC. Install Windows first, then try again."
msgstr ""
"Auf diesem PC wurde kein Windows gefunden. Installiere zuerst Windows und versuch es dann noch mal."

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:290
msgid "Not found"
msgstr "Nicht gefunden"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:292
msgid "Unavailable (not a UEFI system)"
msgstr "Nicht verfügbar (kein UEFI-System)"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:351
msgid "Play %1 on Windows?"
msgstr "%1 unter Windows spielen?"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:352
msgid "Open in Windows?"
msgstr "In Windows öffnen?"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:353
msgid "Play on Windows?"
msgstr "Unter Windows spielen?"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:359
msgid "Your PC will restart in Windows and open it. Open apps will close."
msgstr ""
"Dein PC startet in Windows neu und öffnet sie. Offene Apps werden geschlossen."

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:360
msgid ""
"Your PC will restart in Windows and start the game. When you quit, it comes back to Monet."
msgstr ""
"Dein PC startet in Windows neu und öffnet das Spiel. Wenn du es beendest, kehrt er zu Monet zurück."

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:361
msgid ""
"Your PC will restart in Windows with your game launchers ready to sign in to. Open apps will close."
msgstr ""
"Dein PC startet in Windows neu, wo deine Spiele-Launcher zum Anmelden bereitstehen. Offene Apps werden geschlossen."

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:362
msgid ""
"Your PC will restart in Windows, update it and your games, and switch off when they're done. Open apps will close."
msgstr ""
"Dein PC startet in Windows neu, aktualisiert Windows und deine Spiele und schaltet sich aus, wenn alles fertig ist. Offene Apps werden geschlossen."

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:363
msgid "Your PC will restart in Windows. Open apps will close."
msgstr "Dein PC startet in Windows neu. Offene Apps werden geschlossen."

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:365
msgid ""
"Save your work first. Unsaved changes and private tabs aren't captured. Downloads stop during the restart; check Store's Downloads when you return."
msgstr ""

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:597
msgid ""
"Monet seems to have started from the Windows entry, which shouldn't happen."
msgstr ""
"Monet wurde anscheinend über den Windows-Eintrag gestartet, was nicht passieren sollte."

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:636
msgid ""
"This PC's firmware didn't keep the switch to Windows. Restart and choose Windows in the PC's boot menu."
msgstr ""
"Die Firmware dieses PCs hat den Wechsel zu Windows nicht übernommen. Starte neu und wähle Windows im Bootmenü des PCs."

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:667
msgid ""
"The restart was blocked. The switch to Windows was cancelled. Save your work and try again."
msgstr ""

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:685
msgid ""
"Monet couldn't identify your desktop account. Start Windows from your desktop and try again."
msgstr ""

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:691
msgid "Your desktop account could not be found. The switch was cancelled."
msgstr ""

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:815
msgid "This copy of Monet can't install Windows by itself."
msgstr "Dieses Monet kann Windows nicht von selbst installieren."

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:874
msgid ""
"Monet can install Windows from %1. Your PC restarts and Windows installs itself."
msgstr ""
